       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CICS-ROUTER.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-PGM PIC X(8).
       01 WS-FLAG PIC X.
       01 RC PIC S9(8) COMP.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN.
           MOVE 'DETAIL' TO WS-PGM.
           IF WS-FLAG = 'Y'
               MOVE 'SUMMARY' TO WS-PGM
           END-IF.
           EXEC CICS LINK PROGRAM(WS-PGM) RESP(RC) END-EXEC.
           EXEC CICS LINK PROGRAM('AUDIT') RESP(RC) END-EXEC.
           EXEC CICS XCTL PROGRAM('MENU') RESP(RC) END-EXEC.
           GOBACK.
